haltia-messenger (2.7.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * You can now make voice calls to MAX contacts. An incoming call rings and
    wakes the tablet’s screen; one big button answers it. Before calling a
    contact, the program asks «Позвонить …?» (Call …?).
  * During a call, the other person’s voice comes through the speaker and echo
    is suppressed on the tablet. The tablet stays awake until the call ends.
  * A second call during a conversation gets a busy answer. Quitting the
    program ends the call properly.
  * Calls are available only where the needed GStreamer components are
    installed.
  * The licence is now GPL-3.0-or-later.

 -- Haltia <rensomail@gmail.com>  Wed, 21 Oct 2026 23:30:00 +0300

